  "body": "\r\n## [21.2.4](https://github.com/conventional-changelog/commitlint/compare/v21.2.3...v21.2.4) (2026-10-18)\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* fix(load): replace config file arrays with seed arrays by @escapedcat in https://github.com/conventional-changelog/commitlint/pull/5056\r\n* fix: update dependency jsonc to v3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/conventional-changelog/commitlint/pull/5020\r\n\r\n### Performance Improvements\r\n\r\n\r\n* perf(load): load typescript configs with jiti directly by @escapedcat in https://github.com/conventional-changelog/commitlint/pull/5052\r\n\r\n### Docs, etc\r\n\r\n* docs: add AGENTS.md with commit type guidance by @escapedcat in https://github.com/conventional-changelog/commitlint/pull/5053\r\n* test(ensure): pin case conversion of digits, punctuation and accents by @escapedcat in https://github.com/conventional-changelog/commitlint/pull/5055\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/conventional-changelog/commitlint/compare/v21.2.3...v21.2.4\r\n\r\n",
